<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH F.A. CUP REVISED DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH F.A. CUP REVISED DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revised draw for the fourth round</p>
<p>of the Scottish F.A. Cup after matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Saturday, Feb 15: Brechin v Raith, Clyde v Kilmarnock,</p>
<p>Falkirk v Dunfermline, Greenock Morton v Dundee, Motherwell v</p>
<p>Hamilton, Rangers v East Fife</p>
<p>Sunday, Feb 16 :Hearts v Dundee United</p>
<p>Monday, Feb 17 Hibernian v Celtic</p>
